<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><BaseHead title="Terms — Paisa Inbox" description="Beta terms for Paisa Inbox and its Account Aggregator connection." /></head><body><main class="legal-page"><a href="/">← Back to Paisa Inbox</a><span class="eyebrow">BETA TERMS</span><h1>A clearer view, not financial advice.</h1><p class="lead">Paisa Inbox organises financial information and supports personal reflection. It is not a bank, Account Aggregator, payment service, accountant, tax adviser, lender, or investment adviser.</p>
<div class="legal-callout"><strong>Not yet public-launch terms</strong><p>The operator’s legal identity, governing law, dispute forum, commercial plan, support terms, and provider agreements must be completed and reviewed before public onboarding.</p></div>
<h2>Your responsibility</h2><p>Use Paisa only with accounts and records you are authorised to access. Verify transactions, categories, budgets, reimbursements, loan allocations, and insights against your bank records before relying on them. Keep authoritative statements where you need them.</p>
<h2>Account Aggregator connection</h2><p>Bank connection is optional. If you choose it, Paisa creates a purpose-limited request through Setu’s AA Gateway and redirects you to a hosted consent journey. You choose accounts and approve, reject, or later revoke consent. Paisa never promises that every bank, account, or transaction is available through the AA ecosystem.</p>
<h2>Timing and accuracy</h2><p>AA data can arrive periodically, partially, late, or not at all. Reversals, refunds, merchant names, balances, and classifications may be incomplete or corrected later. Paisa reconciles matching signals but does not guarantee real-time capture or perfect categorisation.</p>
<h2>Acceptable use</h2><p>Do not access another person’s information, misrepresent authority, bypass security, overload the service, scrape private records, or use Paisa for unlawful monitoring, lending decisions, credit scoring, or discrimination.</p>
<h2>Availability and changes</h2><p>This is a beta. Features, providers, and data formats may change; service may be interrupted for maintenance, security, provider outages, or legal reasons. Material changes affecting consent or data use require updated notice and, where required, fresh consent.</p>
<h2>Ending use</h2><p>You may export your data, revoke bank consent, or delete your account using in-app controls. Account deletion attempts to revoke current AA consents before removing local data. Provider and bank records remain subject to their own legal obligations.</p>
<p class="legal-note">Last updated: 17 August 2026. These beta terms describe current product boundaries and do not evidence commercial-launch legal approval.</p></main></body></html>
